msgid "Try it"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/07-text-and-regex.md:208
msgid "Clean `\"  GREEN   build  ltd \"` into `\"Green Build Ltd\"`. You need [`split`](https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str.split), [`join`](https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str.join) and [`title`](https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str.title)."
